{%- comment -%}
  snippets/rueiv-price-resolver.liquid
  ────────────────────────────────────
  Locked storefront price policy (PR #12 / owner):
  - Guest (Liquid `customer` absent): never show price UI or JSON-LD offers
  - Authenticated storefront customer: show authoritative variant price when > 0
  - Zero/blank variant price: always hidden (trade/quote catalog convention)

  override.price_hidden semantic:
  Hub maps price_authority quote|hidden|trade → override.price_hidden for trade/quote
  catalog labeling. Repo contract (hub_shopify_field_mapping.md, metafield schema)
  describes guest/showroom suppression only — it does NOT document force-hidden
  behavior for authenticated storefront customers. Under the locked policy,
  price_hidden therefore does NOT override authenticated-customer visibility.

  Shopify Admin/staff login does NOT populate Liquid `customer`; verify with a
  real storefront customer session.

  Sets: rueiv_show_price (boolean), rueiv_price_hidden (boolean)

  Usage:
    {% render 'rueiv-price-resolver', product: product %}
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign _variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
  assign _price = _variant.price

  assign rueiv_show_price = false
  assign rueiv_price_hidden = true

  if _price == blank or _price == 0
    assign rueiv_show_price = false
    assign rueiv_price_hidden = true
  elsif customer
    assign rueiv_show_price = true
    assign rueiv_price_hidden = false
  endif
-%}
